Quick compilation instructions (Linux):

1) Install a compiler and the GTK 3 development files, e.g. on
   Debian/Ubuntu:
       sudo apt install build-essential pkg-config libgtk-3-dev
2) make
3) sudo make install

   This installs impfe into /usr/local/bin and its man page into
   /usr/local/share/man. Use "make install PREFIX=/usr" to change that,
   or just copy impfe somewhere in your path.

Default server port for Imperium is 3458
